&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Luno is the crypto investment app you can rely on, enabling you to buy, store and explore crypto securely. We’re committed to putting the power of cryptocurrency in everyone&#39;s hands sensibly and responsibly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2013, we’ve helped millions of people around the world invest safely in crypto. We do this by cutting through the hype and supporting customers at every step of the way. All products and cryptocurrencies on our platform must first meet stringent legal, risk and technical security standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Transparency is key for us. Luno stores all crypto on a 1:1 basis and we have rigorous processes in place so you can be confident your investment is secure. We’re available in more than 40 countries around the world and we work closely with respective regulators in all of these markets to be fully compliant, as we believe this is the best way to help everyone, everywhere, invest safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a newly formed team using AI to automate critical work across the business — from Operational teams handling huge volumes of queries and complex reports, to Product and Engineering teams automating more of how they build. AI isn’t the only tool in your toolkit, but it plays a large part in how we create software to solve these problems, or is used as part of the solutions themselves. This is a new and exciting area for Luno, core to our strategy and success. You&#39;ll report directly to the VP of Product, who&#39;ll work closely with you while the team and its priorities are still taking shape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role in a nutshell:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You own the product surface for operational automation, and bring thought leadership and a product mindset to automating our build processes and pipelines. That means building genuine relationships with stakeholders across the business who are counting on you to help their teams succeed, and winning buy-in and enthusiasm from operational and build teams for change they didn&#39;t ask for.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission will be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering against an agreed set of automation opportunities with Customer Success, Onboarding Operations, Anti-Financial Crime and other operational teams — reducing manual work, increasing quality, or reducing risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding the processes and systems behind each opportunity deeply enough to redesign them with a technology partner, not just automate what already exists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deciding, case by case and with guidance, what should be automated versus what needs human judgement to stay ethical and compliant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building the relationships with operational leaders that make each rollout successful — their teams need to trust what you ship, not just receive it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
