&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating at the intersection of product and compliance, without waiting for someone else to define the problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You quantify impact, risk and confidence, and use that to prioritise work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built solutions, and you&#39;ve bought them, and you know how to weigh one against the other honestly&lt;/li&gt;
