&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join Pod Captivate, the team that owns how retail customers discover, browse and engage with everything Luno offers; the parts of the app that help them find new opportunities, understand what to do next, and come back to do more of it. Beyond the core browsing and navigation experience, the pod also owns key products including Staking, Stablecoin Earn, Bundles and Prediction Markets. The pod has recently reshaped how customers navigate and discover products in the app, with further engagement-focused improvements already in motion. You&#39;ll report to the Group Product Manager for Retail Investing &amp;amp; Growth and work with dedicated engineering, delivery and UX/information-architecture partners.&lt;/p&gt;
