&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role in a nutshell:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the experience that turns a single-asset, single-product customer into a multi-asset, multi-product one. You will own the browsing, discovery and engagement layer that decides whether someone who opens the app once ever comes back to do more. Product depth and breadth are the two clearest levers we have on lifetime customer value. Your job is to pull both, deliberately, for new and existing retail customers, everywhere Luno operates.&lt;/p&gt;
