&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing and CRM on lifecycle engagement, so the moments after a customer&#39;s first transaction do as much work as the moments before it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the next iteration of engagement mechanics; staking and earn gamification, subscriber actions, incentive and referral programmes and make the case for what&#39;s worth resourcing next&lt;/li&gt;
