&lt;li&gt;Our AML, CTF, CPF &amp;amp; Sanctions team is responsible for the implementation of money&lt;br&gt;laundering, terrorist financing, proliferation financing and sanctions risk mitigation&lt;br&gt;controls for Luno&#39;s global business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our mission is to create a world-class AML, CTF, CPF &amp;amp; Sanctions Team that keeps&lt;br&gt;both Luno and our customers safe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work in a fast paced environment, collaborating with other business units,&lt;br&gt;including Engineering, Product, Countries and Legal teams, servicing the business on&lt;br&gt;an international level together with the teams from Africa, Asia Pacific and the UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We make sure we have the processes and information available that enable us to&lt;br&gt;understand our risk, and using this foundation, we respond to any money laundering,&lt;br&gt;terrorist financing, proliferation financing and sanctions related risks in a swift&lt;br&gt;coordinated way.&lt;/li&gt;
